  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(P\\) is in the fourth quadrant, so \\(a>0\\) and \\(b<0\\). Thus, \\(-b>0\\) and \\(a>0\\). Both coordinates of \\(Q\\) are positive, so it is in the first quadrant.",
